    reason: Input files updated by another job: results/8-cdr_finder/bed/T2T05_CDR.live.bed
    resources: mem_mb=8000, mem_mib=7630, disk_mb=1000, disk_mib=954, tmpdir=/tmp, mem=8GB
Shell command: 
        cut -f1-3 results/8-cdr_finder/bed/T2T05_CDR.live.bed |         sort -k1,1 |         join - <(cat results/final/bed/T2T05_complete_cens.bed | sort -k1,1) |         awk -v OFS="\t" '{
